DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260928
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Primary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: T
 otal Cost Index (TCI)
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Primary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Total Cost 
 Index (TCI)\nPrimary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Total Cost Index 
 (TCI)\nSep 28\, 2026\nWe invite PCPlus providers to a quality webinar seri
 es that educates providers and administrators on best practices related to
  quality measures in the PCPlus program. This series helps practices optim
 ize their performance and payment while aligning with industry best practi
 ces for population and patient health. MaineCare PCPlus quality measures c
 an be found on the\nPCPlus website\n.\nJoin us today\nSeptember 28\, 2026\
 , from 12:00-1:00 PM\nfor our next webinar. We are partnering with The Cut
 ler Institute to learn more about the TCI measure and review the measure
 ’s specifications. More information on the TCI measure can be found on t
 he\nHealth Partners Website\n.\nPlease register\nin advance for this meeti
 ng. After registering\, you will receive a confirmation email with informa
 tion about joining the meeting.\nFor questions about PCPlus\, please conta
 ct us at\nPCP-Network-Services.DHHS@maine.gov\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dh
 hs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/primary-care-plus-pcplus-quality-webin
 ar-total-cost-index-tci-2026-09-28
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/primary-ca
 re-plus-pcplus-quality-webinar-total-cost-index-tci-2026-09-28
